 class=\"product-color-text\">upstairs</span>, <span class=\"product-color-text\">mall</span>, <span class=\"product-color-text\">great</span>, <span class=\"product-color-text\">edge</span>, <span class=\"product-color-text\">run-down</span>, or <span class=\"product-color-text\">exhibit</span></span>. <span class = \"bullet\">Record yourself saying the sentences aloud.</span> <span class=\"bullet\">Check your pronunciation with your instructor.</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "You have 2 attempts to submit your answers.", "type": "text"}]}], "type": "TYP", "questions": [{"id": 0, "_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"content": "The grey house is sitting on the", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "post_question", "contents": {"content": "of town.", "type": ""}}, {"content": "secondary_2", "type": "objective"}], "responses": [{"correct": 0, "id": 0, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0}, {"correct": 1, "id": 1, "_data": [{"content": "edge", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0}]}, {"id": 1, "_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"content": "There are so many", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "post_question", "contents": {"content": "attractions in Boston.", "type": ""}}, {"content": "secondary_2", "type": "objective"}], "responses": [{"correct": 0, "id": 0, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0}, {"correct": 1, "id": 1, "_data": [{"content": "great", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0}]}, {"id": 2, "_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"content": "John, let's stop at this art exhibit", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "post_question", "contents": {"content": ".", "type": ""}}, {"content": "secondary_2", "type": "objective"}], "responses": [{"correct": 0, "id": 0, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0}, {"correct": 1, "id": 1, "_data": [{"content": "upstairs", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0}]}, {"id": 3, "_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"content": "The painting shows an old,", "type": "text